# Laravel scheduler every minute (bots:scan / bots:settle, candles:prune-old, …).
# Install: crontab -e → paste ONE line below, adjusting the absolute project path and php binary if needed.
#
# Important: `cd` must use an absolute path to the directory that contains `artisan`.
# Full deployment notes: docs/DEPLOYMENT.md

* * * * * cd /home/o/platform && /usr/bin/php artisan schedule:run >> /home/o/platform/storage/logs/scheduler.log 2>&1
